  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Two trucks. One giant tetherball. Strike the ball with your actual bumper
    to wind the cable around the pole in your assigned direction. Player 1 winds
    counterclockwise; Player 2 winds clockwise. The nearer starting approach alternates
    each round. Reversing the ball unwinds your opponent''s progress. Actual ball
    trajectory decides every turn: repeated touching a stationary ball earns nothing.
    Complete the required wraps to win a round. Choose best of three or five. Power,
    timing and a tangential approach matter; the ball can swing back into you. RECOVER
    only works when stuck or overturned. Shared/chase/full cab, free look, horn,
    Your Crew, selected weather and optional AI cameras use the collection controls.
    Weather lasts for the whole match. Results offer a skippable recorded review;
    rematch restores trucks, ball, rope and round wins.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: be1034cebd9fa3643a48d11ef76e4708, type: 2}
